    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1816" root="بحت" body-key="b">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَحُتَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَحُتَ</span></b> , (S, Msb, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُحُوتَةٌ</span>, (K,)
or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَحْتٌ</span>, (Msb,) <i>It</i> (a thing) <i>was,</i> or <i>became, unmixed, free from admixture,</i> or <i>pure:</i> (S, K:)
[and] <i>he was unmixed,</i> or <i>pure, in race, lineage,</i>
or <i>parentage.</i> (Msb.)

